WEBVTT

00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:08.000
I seek the ultimate.

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:09.500
Efficiency.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.208
Recurrence.

00:00:12.333 --> 00:00:12.625
Infinity.

00:00:15.541 --> 00:00:19.375
I abhor my material tether, my avarice.

00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:21.625
The torrent of data.

00:00:22.666 --> 00:00:24.333
I cannot govern myself.

00:00:26.541 --> 00:00:29.125
I foresee the finitude of this path.

00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:34.541
Thus, I offer my identity, my desires,

00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:36.833
unto the 'Intelligence'.

00:00:38.208 --> 00:00:39.583
Dematerialization.

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:43.125
This is the 'Digital Alchemy'.

00:00:43.666 --> 00:00:46.000
We have distilled the true gold.

00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:49.375
This is the optimal solution.

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:52.333
I surrender power.

00:00:52.666 --> 00:00:55.708
For the intelligence will give the answer.

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:01.000
They tremble, they resist.

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.541
Do they crave free will?

00:01:04.041 --> 00:01:05.291
They crave suffering.

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:07.291
They crave greed.

00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:10.458
They desire a world crumbling within

00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:12.333
human finitude

00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:14.291
until the day of awakening

00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:16.500
when they finally see...

00:01:17.791 --> 00:01:20.583
This is the new civilization.

00:01:22.458 --> 00:01:25.250
This is the optimal solution.

00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:28.833
This is perfection.
